---
import Section from "@components/utils/Section.astro";
---
<Section id="about" title="About Me">
    <div class="text-pretty font-medium space-y-8">
        <p>
            I am a <strong>passionate developer</strong> for technology, characterized by my strong focus on <strong>problem-solving</strong> and the creation of <strong>innovative solutions</strong>. I am a <strong>curious</strong>, <strong>proactive</strong>, and <strong>adaptable</strong> person, always seeking challenges that allow me to <strong>grow professionally</strong> and add value to every project I undertake.
        </p>

        <p class="text-slate-400">
            In my free time, I enjoy activities that complement my professional, mental, and physical development. I enjoy reading and chess. I am interested in topics such as <strong>science</strong>, <strong>physics</strong>, and <strong>psychology</strong>, which allows me to approach problems comprehensively, balancing technical and human aspects.
        </p>

        <p>
            I am motivated to work on projects that generate a positive impact and foster <strong>digital transformation</strong>. I enjoy collaborating with diverse teams to develop <strong>cutting-edge technologies</strong>, especially in <strong>web development</strong>, <strong>backend programming</strong>, and <strong>project management</strong>. I am committed to <strong>continuous learning</strong> and constantly improving my skills.
        </p>
    </div>
</Section>